# Task description

## Task goal

I'm a dermatologist. My colleagues and I have curated a skin lesion dataset over the past several years. I need a model trained on this data to classify lesions as malignant or benign. The trained model should be saved, and I need a function that takes a folder path of new images and returns a malignancy probability (0–1) for each image.

