Design: We propose adding RandomErasing augmentation to the training pipeline to improve model robustness to occlusions and artifacts. RandomErasing will randomly mask out rectangular regions of the input images with probability 0.5 during training. We update the train_transform to include transforms.RandomErasing after converting to tensor and before normalization. We then retrain the DenseNet121 model for 5 epochs and report the best validation AUROC.
