Validation Metric: 0.9123

-------------------------------
Design: I propose adding test-time augmentation (TTA) during validation by averaging model predictions on original and horizontally flipped images to improve robustness. This atomic change does not affect training but can boost AUROC by reducing overfitting on specific orientations. We will apply TTA in both the validation loop and the `predict()` function. The rest of the training pipeline, including CutMix, RandomErasing, and weighted sampling, remains unchanged.
