Design: I propose adding RandAugment to the training pipeline to generate a richer variety of photometric transformations, improving model robustness to color and texture variations without affecting the existing architecture or training loop. We insert `transforms.RandAugment()` after random horizontal flips in the `train_transform`. All other settings, including CutMix, RandomErasing, weighted sampling, and TTA at validation, remain unchanged so we can directly measure the impact of this augmentation.
